  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build a community school to educate 150 children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We will construct and open a community learning center with five classrooms in rural Northern Ghana, for 150 young children to attend school for the first time. In a region with limited school access, our community partners have chosen education as their highest priority. Local teachers use culture and environmental curriculums to inspire children to learn. A small kitchen for school lunches will reduce malnutrition. Solar power and rainwater catchment help make the schools sustainable.</narrative>
  </description>
